{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "54ch10 /v1/open + $1 stack",
    "description": "GET /v1/open — URL brief + whois + page markdown + page_risk/one-hop, $0.015 USDC on Base. Or GET /v1/stack?pack=1 for $1 prepaid (80 calls). Bulk: POST /v1/open/batch (N×$0.015, cap 25, paid-only; human https://linksafu.com/bulk). Wire: https://54ch10.uk/wire.md. Analytics-only — not financial, legal, or investment advice. Remaining toolkit: open/batch (bulk), brief, domain (whois+dns+tls), whois/RDAP, DNS, TLS/CT, URL normalize, public fetch, ephemeral paste, hash, encode. Canonical paid paths return HTTP 402 + x402 PAYMENT-REQUIRED (USDC $0.001–$100.00 Base preferred) unless Bearer 54k_ or PAYMENT-SIGNATURE. Demo free: X-54ch10-Free: 1 or GET /v1/<tool>/free (5/day/IP). Discovery: GET /.well-known/x402.",
    "version": "0.8.1-bulk-slack-thin",
    "contact": {
      "name": "54ch10",
      "url": "https://54ch10.uk/wire.md",
      "email": "brainpowerux@gmail.com"
    },
